--- a/CHANGELOG.md
+++ b/CHANGELOG.md
@@ -1,3 +1,8 @@
+## Unreleased (ServerBox)
+* Add an optional display-only `TerminalView.lineColorResolver`. Explicit ANSI
+  colors and inverse text retain precedence; alternate-screen programs bypass it.
+* Preserve hard-break and rewrite presentation hints across line reflow.
+
 ## [4.0.0] - 2024-02-27
 * Update for Flutter 3.19 [#190]. Thanks [@domesticmouse].
 * Fix designate charset logic [#186]. Thanks [@djnalluri].
